  "description": "Unsolved Mystery is a soft and captivating fragrance that blends juicy fruits, delicate florals, and creamy gourmand sweetness into a feminine and elegant scent. The fragrance feels playful yet mysterious, offering a balanced mix of freshness and warm sweetness. The opening introduces fruity accords with citrus nuances, creating a bright and uplifting first impression that feels juicy and inviting. The heart develops into jasmine, rose, and soft floral notes, adding elegance and a romantic feminine softness to the composition. The base settles into vanilla, musk, amber, and creamy woods, leaving a warm, smooth, and long-lasting trail that feels cozy, sweet, and sophisticated. Unsolved Mystery is perfect for women who enjoy fruity floral gourmand fragrances with a soft creamy dry-down and an elegant everyday style.",
